WHY THIS LICENCE, AND NOT A PERMISSIVE ONE

This repository ships openWakeWord's pre-trained models inside the app, and
those models are offered under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 — NonCommercial, and ShareAlike.
Rather than argue about where an "adaptation" begins when a model is bundled in
an APK, the whole repository carries the same terms. That is the conservative
reading, and it is the correct one while the models are committed here.

This is a personal home kiosk with no commercial purpose, so NonCommercial costs
nothing. If that ever changes, the model files under app/src/main/assets/models/
must be removed before anything is sold, monetised or used in a business, and
this licence revisited.

See NOTICE for what each third-party component is and where it came from,
including the parts of openWakeWord that ARE Apache-2.0.
